~ start
Sonic: Man, what an adventure right? What's even going on anymore?
Tails: I agree this is somewhat entertaining, but I am so confused.
Blaze: Exactly. Why are we fighting and meeting people we've never even met?
Rouge: Like the giant armored guy, the one who nearly tore this place apart, and that thing that looked like Sonic.
Amy: That one was especially unsettling...
Cream: Do you think they're all connected?
Knuckles: The Chaos Emeralds disappeared. I thought they'd end up here.
Silver: They are. And if we fail, things will get much worse.
*Everyone turns toward him.*
Blaze: Okay, future boy. Care to explain?
Silver: Sage is preparing something dangerous. We have to stop her before it's too late.
Tails: Then we shut down the experiment. What's the problem?
Silver: What happens when she asks you to let her continue? Will you hesitate?
Amy: We'll hear her out. There's no reason we can't talk to her.
Silver: And give her more time?
Blaze: You don't know what she's planning. Neither do we.
Silver: I know what happens when people ignore the damage they cause.
Cream: ...
Cream: What if she's just trying to save someone?
Silver: That doesn't excuse putting everyone else in danger.
Sonic: Ah—ACHOO! Ugh, sorry.
Amy: Sonic, you've been sneezing all day. Are you sure you're okay?
Sonic: It's a cold, Amy. I'll survive.
Rouge: Try not to sneeze on anyone important.
*Tails looks back at Silver, growing concerned.*
Tails: ...
Tails: We can stop the experiment without deciding Sage is our enemy.
Silver: And what if giving her another chance puts everyone at risk?
Knuckles: Then we stop her. But we don't abandon her.
Silver: I never said we had to.
Blaze: Then what are you planning to do?
*The elevator slows. Silver stares at the doors as they approach the final floors.*
Silver: I'll stop her. Whatever it takes.
Amy: Silver, we're on your side. You don't have to do this alone.
Silver: If you stand in my way, I won't hesitate.
Sonic: Whoa. We're your friends, remember?
Silver: I hope you don't make me choose between you and the future.
*The elevator chimes. Its doors slide open, revealing a long corridor leading toward the upper floors.*
Cream: Mr. Silver?
Sliver: ...
Silver: I wish we could.
*He steps into the corridor. Blaze follows, visibly troubled, while Amy takes Cream's hand. Tails and Knuckles exchange worried glances before following them.*
Sonic: Ah—ACHOO! ...Seriously? Now?
Rouge: GROSS! Get that cold checked out please.
Sonic: I will. I will. After we figure out what's going on. Come on!
*Sonic hurries after the others, sniffling as they approach the final doors. Whatever awaits them, Silver has already made up his mind.*
A distant metallic crash echoes through the corridor, making everyone stop.
Tails: Please tell me that was part of the experiment.
Silver: We're running out of time.
=> END